# Module memory images from the vendor software's dump buttons.
#
# Deliberately not published, even though this repo's text logs are. These are the raw EEPROM and
# flash contents of named modules on a named car - the cluster image carries the stored odometer and
# the immobiliser-related modules carry their own secrets - and the `_wr` files are write images,
# i.e. exactly the artefact used to alter a cluster. Odometer writing is out of scope for this
# project; publishing the material for it is not a thing to do by accident. The decoded text logs
# next to them carry everything the protocol work actually needs.
log/**/*.bin
log/**/*.epb
